      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1897 the North Pacific Railway built a depot that put Pe Ell on the map for travelers and timber workers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pe_Ell%2C_Washington",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Pe Ell houses the Holy Cross Polish National Catholic Church, a historic landmark listed on the National Register in 1987.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
