      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pe_Ell%2C_Washington",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the 2007 Great Coastal Gale, Pe Ell lost its water supply that had come over the historic Weyerhaeuser bridge.",
